{"seq":2,"slug":"main-thread-blocking","title":"主线程阻塞之痛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/foundations/main-thread-blocking","wordCount":1137,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"主线程阻塞之痛\">主线程阻塞之痛</h1><p>一个按钮点下去要过 300 毫秒才有反应，用户不会去想「这是主线程长任务」，他只会觉得网站卡、烂、不想用。要把 Worker 用在刀刃上，第一步不是学 API，而是学会把这种「卡」量化成可以对比的数字——因为不会度量，就没法证明你的优化到底有没有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-帧预算与长任务\">核心概念：帧预算与长任务</h2><p>屏幕通常每秒刷新 60 次，意味着浏览器每 16.7 毫秒就要产出一帧。这 16.7 毫秒里，主线程既要跑你的 JS，又要算样式、布局、绘制。真正留给 JavaScript 的时间只有几毫秒。一旦某段 JS 连续执行超过这个预算，浏览器就无法按时出帧，画面就「掉帧」；如果它执行超过 50 毫秒，W3C 直接把它定义为<strong>长任务（Long Task）</strong>——因为这段时间里用户的任何输入都得排队等待。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一帧 16.7ms 预算] --&gt; B[JS 执行]&#10;    B --&gt; C[样式计算]&#10;    C --&gt; D[布局 Layout]&#10;    D --&gt; E[绘制 Paint]&#10;    E --&gt; F{是否超预算}&#10;    F --&gt;|未超| G[按时出帧 流畅]&#10;    F --&gt;|JS 占用 200ms| H[连续掉帧&lt;br/&gt;输入排队 界面冻结]&#10;    H --&gt; I[长任务 &gt;50ms 被标记]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一帧 16.7ms 预算] --&gt; B[JS 执行]\n    B --&gt; C[样式计算]\n    C --&gt; D[布局 Layout]\n    D --&gt; E[绘制 Paint]\n    E --&gt; F{是否超预算}\n    F --&gt;|未超| G[按时出帧 流畅]\n    F --&gt;|JS 占用 200ms| H[连续掉帧&lt;br/&gt;输入排队 界面冻结]\n    H --&gt; I[长任务 &gt;50ms 被标记]</pre><p>阻塞的本质是排队。用户在长任务执行期间点击，事件不会丢，但会被挂起，直到当前任务跑完、事件循环回到队列才处理。这段「点了没反应」的等待，正是现代性能指标要抓的东西。事件循环的完整机制在 <a href=\"../../browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/event-loop\">浏览器与 Web API · 事件循环</a> 主讲，这里只关注它与卡顿的关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-inp-把卡顿变成数字\">用 INP 把卡顿变成数字</h2><p>2024 年 Core Web Vitals 用 <strong>INP（Interaction to Next Paint）</strong> 替换了旧的 FID，成为衡量交互响应的核心指标，到 2026 年它已是各家性能工具的默认关注点。INP 度量的是页面整个生命周期内，从用户操作（点击、点按、键入）到界面下一次绘制之间的延迟，取一个接近最差的代表值。它的判定阈值如下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>良好</th>\n<th>需改进</th>\n<th>差</th>\n<th>度量对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>≤ 200ms</td>\n<td>200–500ms</td>\n<td>&gt; 500ms</td>\n<td>交互到下一帧绘制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长任务</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>偶发</td>\n<td>频繁 &gt; 50ms</td>\n<td>单段 JS 执行时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TBT（实验室）</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n<td>200–600ms</td>\n<td>&gt; 600ms</td>\n<td>长任务超 50ms 部分之和</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>INP 的三段延迟——输入延迟、处理时长、呈现延迟——其中「输入延迟」往往就是被别的长任务堵住的时间。把重计算搬进 Worker，正是在削减处理时长与因长任务造成的输入延迟。指标的完整拆解与优化策略见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">Web 性能与 Vitals · 主线程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在-devtools-里看见阻塞\">在 DevTools 里看见阻塞</h2><p>数字之外，你要能亲眼看到长任务。Chrome DevTools 的 Performance 面板录制一段交互后，主线程轨道上超过 50 毫秒的任务会被标上红色三角旗；Interactions 轨道会画出每次交互的三段延迟。程序化地，你也可以用 <code>PerformanceObserver</code> 订阅长任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    if (entry.duration &gt; 50) {&#10;      console.warn(`长任务 ${entry.duration.toFixed(0)}ms`, entry.attribution);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;longtask&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (entry.duration > 50) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      console.warn(`长任务 ${entry.duration.toFixed(0)}ms`, entry.attribution);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>observer.observe({ type: 'longtask', buffered: true });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码能在真实用户环境里捕获长任务，配合上报就成了简易的 RUM。要衡量 Worker 优化的效果，标准做法是：优化前录一次基线（长任务数量、总时长、INP），把计算移进 Worker 后再录一次，对比两条曲线——如果主线程的红旗消失了、INP 从 400 毫秒降到 150 毫秒，才算真的有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阻塞的时间模型\">阻塞的时间模型</h2><p>设一次交互的响应延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，它由输入延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、处理时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、呈现延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 组成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_i + T_p + T_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当页面存在一个正在执行的长任务、剩余时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，新到来的交互至少要等它跑完，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i \\geq T_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的计算移进 Worker，主线程上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 0（只剩派发消息的开销），同时消除了它对后续交互造成的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这就是 Worker 压低 INP 的数学解释——它不缩短计算本身，而是把计算从「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的关键路径」上挪走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>每帧只有约 16.7ms 预算，留给 JS 的仅几毫秒；连续执行超 50ms 的 JS 被定义为长任务。</li>\n<li>阻塞的本质是事件排队：长任务执行期间用户输入被挂起，表现为「点了没反应」。</li>\n<li>INP（≤200ms 为良好）是 2026 年衡量交互响应的核心指标，长任务是它最大的敌人。</li>\n<li>用 Performance 面板的红旗和 <code>PerformanceObserver(&#39;longtask&#39;)</code> 定位并量化阻塞。</li>\n<li>Worker 通过把计算移出关键路径来降 INP，度量时要用「优化前后对比」证明收益。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"why-web-workers\">为何需要 Web Worker</a>：Worker 换来的是主线程空闲。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"worker-types\">Worker 类型（专用/共享/Service）</a>：把哪类计算放进哪种线程。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">Web 性能与 Vitals · 主线程性能</a>：INP 与长任务的完整优化方法论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主线程阻塞之痛","id":"主线程阻塞之痛"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：帧预算与长任务","id":"核心概念-帧预算与长任务"},{"level":2,"text":"用 INP 把卡顿变成数字","id":"用-inp-把卡顿变成数字"},{"level":2,"text":"在 DevTools 里看见阻塞","id":"在-devtools-里看见阻塞"},{"level":2,"text":"阻塞的时间模型","id":"阻塞的时间模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要 Web Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/foundations/why-web-workers"},"next":{"title":"Worker 类型：专用、共享与 Service","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/foundations/worker-types"}}